Replaced the second profile lookup with a direct field-index lookup on the already-fetched message pointer, avoiding a redundant `Profile::GetMesg` call. This reduces the constructor to a single table lookup plus a cheap per-message search.

```cpp
Field::Field(const FIT_UINT16 mesgNum, const FIT_UINT8 fieldNum)
    : FieldBase()
    , profile(Profile::GetMesg(mesgNum))
    , profileIndex(FIT_UINT8_INVALID)
    , type(FIT_UINT8_INVALID)
    , isFieldExpanded(FIT_FALSE)
{
    if (profile)
    {
        profileIndex = profile->GetFieldIndex(fieldNum);
    }
}
```